    "body": "FILE_ERROR_IN_USE means the device is busy.\r\n\r\nThe behavior between the VCP driver and built-in driver makes it sound like at some point you granted your site access to both versions of the device. If you click the lock icon, clear all the serial port permissions for the site and only grant it permission using one of the two drivers does that improve the behavior?",
